400
00:41:10,690 --> 00:41:13,690
心の声を聞かないふりで
Feigning ignorance of my heart's voice,

401
00:41:13,690 --> 00:41:17,190
走る私の矛盾が揺れる
my running contradictions waver.

402
00:41:29,890 --> 00:41:33,690
愛しい気持ち 許せない気持ち
These beloved feelings, these unforgivable feelings—

403
00:41:33,690 --> 00:41:37,690
