wanting to question them, but the weakness is painful.

404
00:41:37,690 --> 00:41:43,690
どうしてあなたに出会ったのか
Why did I ever cross paths with you?

405
00:41:48,690 --> 00:41:54,190
確かな繋がり感じてたよ
I felt a certain connection between us,

406
00:41:58,690 --> 00:42:04,190
