but the illusion was shattered to pieces, wasn't it?

407
00:42:05,890 --> 00:42:08,690
祈りも恋もデイジーン
Prayers and love are a daydream,

408
00:42:08,690 --> 00:42:12,690
夢は夢でしかないと
knowing that dreams are only dreams.

409
00:42:12,690 --> 00:42:18,890
嘆きの果ての 変わらずにいまロスター
