笑えないメロディ きらめきにのって きらめき纏って
A melody that can't make you smile, riding on the sparkling light, draped in sparkle.

516
00:53:20,813 --> 00:53:25,313
ありがとう！
Thank you!

517
00:54:02,813 --> 00:54:08,113
あの空で輝いた流れ星を追いかけて
Chasing the shooting star that shone in that sky,

518
00:54:08,213 --> 00:54:14,513
いつか君を照らすから 星製のスターライト
so I can someday illuminate you, starlight of Hoshimachi!

519
00:54:26,313 --> 00:54:37,813
生まれたばかりの小さな光は 消えてしまいそうな声で歌を歌ったんだ
The newborn little light sang a song with a voice that seemed like it might fade away.

520
00:54:39,313 --> 00:54:50,313
誰かに届くようにそっとその声を振り絞って 今はまだ響かないけどいつかその心に
Straining that voice softly so it would reach someone, it doesn't resonate yet now, but someday in that heart...

521
00:54:51,313 --> 00:55:02,313
満天の星を降らせよう 眩いほどきらめくよ 何もかも忘れるくらい飛びっきりのステージを
Let's rain down a sky full of stars, sparkling so dazzlingly, an extraordinary stage so wonderful you'll forget everything else!

522
00:55:03,921 --> 00:55:05,651
声は眠れない
My voice won't let me sleep,

523
00:55:05,651 --> 00:55:09,301
ほどに胸を躍らせて
making my heart race so much.

524
00:55:10,701 --> 00:55:11,901
手を取って さぁ行こう
Take my hand, let's go now

525
00:55:12,351 --> 00:55:15,151
星生のスターライト
to the starlight of our birth.

526
00:55:15,551 --> 00:55:16,351
Let's go!

527
00:55:27,551 --> 00:55:30,951
叶えたい 願いを
The wish I want to come true,

528
00:55:30,951 --> 00:55:35,901
浮かべた光は すれ違いで愛を待ってる
the floating light is waiting for love as we cross paths.

529
00:55:36,101 --> 00:55:38,501
早く見つけてよ
Find me soon.

530
00:55:39,251 --> 00:55:41,351
理想を描いただけじゃ
Just drawing ideals

531
00:55:41,351 --> 00:55:44,451
きっと前に進めない
surely won't let me move forward.

532
00:55:44,451 --> 00:55:50,901
踏み出したばかりだけど いつかその胸に
I've only just stepped out, but someday in that heart...

533
00:55:51,901 --> 00:55:54,151
満開の花を咲かせよ
Let's make full-bloomed flowers bloom,

534
00:55:54,151 --> 00:55:58,051
宇宙にしてみせるから
turning it into a universe.

535
00:55:58,401 --> 00:56:03,751
次元さえも越えるくらい 飛び切りのドリームを
With a dream so extraordinary it transcends dimensions,

536
00:56:04,651 --> 00:56:07,551
あげる 今夜は覚めないで
I'll give it to you. Don't wake up tonight.

537
00:56:07,701 --> 00:56:10,451
一度きりの瞬間だって
Even if it's just a fleeting moment,

538
00:56:10,701 --> 00:56:12,751
大事なのは ほら行くよ
what matters is... look, here we go.

539
00:56:12,751 --> 00:56:15,951
星生のスターライト
To the starlight of our birth.

540
00:56:16,001 --> 00:56:16,801
Let's go!

541
